## Text fallback

`rt_mutex_start_proxy_lock` first has a direct success return (`ret=1`). Only
the non-acquired path calls `task_blocks_on_rt_mutex`; its self-deadlock early
return happens before `waiter->task` assignment. An owner-release condition can
reset a nonzero result to zero. The remaining cleanup call is reached only when
the post-reset result is still nonzero, which is a control-flow fact—not proof
of a runtime mismatch. `futex_requeue` then branches on positive, zero or
negative proxy outcomes.
